### ✅ Working Pharmacy Medicine Filtering API Examples

# Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy

### 1. ❌ INCORRECT - This won't work with genericName filtering
### GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines?genericName=Omeprazole

### ✅ CORRECT - Use the search endpoint
### Generic Name Filtering (This is what you need!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=Omeprazole&page=1&limit=10

### 2. Generic Name Case-Insensitive Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=omeprazole&page=1&limit=10

### 3. Partial Generic Name Matching
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=omep&page=1&limit=10

### 4. Price Range Filtering ✅ ALREADY IMPLEMENTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=100&page=1&limit=10

### 5. Created Date Range Filtering ✅ ALREADY IMPLEMENTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10

### 6. Combined Filtering Examples
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=Omeprazole&priceMin=5&priceMax=50&page=1&limit=10

### 7. Price + Date Range Combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?priceMin=10&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&createdDateTo=2024-12-31&page=1&limit=10

### 8. All Filters Combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=omeprazole&priceMin=5&priceMax=100&createdDateFrom=2024-01-01&sortBy=price&sortOrder=asc&page=1&limit=10

### 9. Generic Name + Stock Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=Omeprazole&stockMin=10&stockMax=500&page=1&limit=10

### 10. Search with Category Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/medicines/search?genericName=Omeprazole&category=64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde&page=1&limit=10

### Expected Response Format:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Medicines retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "medicines": [
      {
        "id": "64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde",
        "name": "Omeprazole 20mg Capsule",
        "genericName": "Omeprazole",
        "category": "64f8a2b4c3d4e5f6789abcde",
        "price": 25.50,
        "stock": 100,
        "status": "active",
        "createdAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z",
        "manufacturer": "PharmaCorp",
        "description": "Proton pump inhibitor",
        "dosage": "1 capsule daily"
      }
    ],
    "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10,
      "total": 5,
      "totalPages": 1
    }
  },
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00.000Z"
}

### ✅ All Available Filter Parameters:

**Text Filters:**
- `genericName` - Filter by generic name (case-insensitive partial match)
- `name` - Filter by medicine name (case-insensitive partial match)  
- `query` - Search in both name and genericName fields

**Category:**
- `category` - Filter by category ID (exact match)

**Price Range:**
- `priceMin` - Minimum price (inclusive)
- `priceMax` - Maximum price (inclusive)

**Stock Range:**
- `stockMin` - Minimum stock quantity (inclusive)
- `stockMax` - Maximum stock quantity (inclusive)

**Date Range:**
- `createdDateFrom` - Created date range start (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- `createdDateTo` - Created date range end (YYYY-MM-DD format)

**Sorting:**
- `sortBy` - Field: name, genericName, price, stock, createdAt
- `sortOrder` - asc or desc

**Pagination:**
- `page` - Page number (default: 1)
- `limit` - Items per page (default: 10)

### 🔧 Key Implementation Details:
- Generic name filtering uses regex: `{ genericName: { $regex: genericName, $options: 'i' } }`
- Price filtering uses MongoDB range query with $gte and $lte operators
- Date filtering handles timezone properly and includes end-of-day for createdDateTo
- All filters are combined with AND logic
- Only returns active medicines (status: 'active')
- Default sorting is by createdAt (descending) when no sort specified